---
# ansible-lint configuration.
#
# Discovered when ansible-lint is run from the `ansible/` directory, which is
# where all commands in this repo are run from (see CLAUDE.md).

skip_list:
  # role-name requires ^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$, which `hypervisor-networking` fails
  # on its hyphen. Ansible itself loads hyphenated role names fine — this is a
  # naming convention, not a functional constraint. Renaming would churn
  # site.yml, tests/test-hypervisor-networking-rollback.yml, CLAUDE.md and
  # several docs, all to satisfy a cosmetic rule, so the rule is skipped
  # instead. Revisit if the role is ever renamed for other reasons.
  - role-name
